# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Dependencies
**/node_modules

# Build outputs. `out` and `.next` are produced by a local `npm run build`; without
# these entries a stale local export was copied into the build context (and then
# overwritten inside the image), inflating both.
**/build
**/dist
**/.next
new_frontend/out

# Docs and metadata that never affect the build
README.md
LICENSE
**/design.md
.github

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# IDE and editor files
.idea
.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
.DS_Store

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
logs
*.log

# Docker files
.docker
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
.dockerignore

# Testing
**/coverage

# Database
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
.cache 